 "address": "Jesse Owenshof 1-89, Amsterdam Nieuw-West: 1995 U-shaped courtyard block over a car park deck, pale grey-cream brick wings of four and five storeys with punched white windows and stacked loggias, a darker brick top storey on the five-storey side, glazed stair towers with blue spandrels at the wing ends, red brick end walls under a ribbon-window top storey (kit2 recipe, lane kit-batch-8504-20261121: not installed)",
